From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:23:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: net: bluetooth: brcm: Add BCM4355C0 on Apple
 J71t
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The iPad 5 (J71t) has a BCM4355 Bluetooth controller of the C0
revision on a UART. Like the C1 parts on the iPad 6 and 7, it needs a
board-specific power and setup sequence, so it gets a board compatible
with the generic BCM4355C0 compatible as fallback.

Signed-off-by: Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
[Orchard: from brkosebay/linux 968128fb (J71t ledger 4.2); renamed
 apple,j71t-bcm4355-bt to apple,j71t-bcm4355c0-bt with the
 brcm,bcm4355c0-bt fallback, matching the chip revision]
Co-developed-by: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Signed-off-by: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/net/bluetooth/brcm,bluetooth.yaml      | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/bluetooth/brcm,bluetooth.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/bluetooth/brcm,bluetooth.yaml
index a79982c00..fa0716ae0 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/bluetooth/brcm,bluetooth.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/bluetooth/brcm,bluetooth.yaml
@@ -18,6 +18,9 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - const: brcm,bcm4355c0-bt
           - const: brcm,bcm4345c5
+      - items:
+          - const: apple,j71t-bcm4355c0-bt
+          - const: brcm,bcm4355c0-bt
       - items:
           - enum:
               - apple,j71b-bcm4355c1-bt
